      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "config": {
            "name": "RFP Intake Architecture",
            "position": [
              -220,
              60
            ],
            "parameters": {
              "width": 560,
              "height": 300,
              "content": "CLEANING RFP INTAKE\n\n1. Webhook POST cleaning/rfp (multipart PDF)\n2. Extract PDF text\n3. AI outputs bid checklist + scope summary\n4. Append RFP_QA sheet status=pending_review\n5. Slack deficiency alert if scope gaps found\n\nHuman QA gate before bid submission."
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8d63a4d3-128b-4886-84d7-d20907ea5ac8",
      "name": "Sticky Note b0857e61",
